Mmemme njikwa-ebe-nchekwa: 0.

Mpụta dee: (6 < 5), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (2 > 1), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (2 ≤ 1), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (9 ≥ 1), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (2 adịghị-nkewa-abụọ?), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (4 nkewa-abụọ?), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (-1 karịa-efu?), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (-2 erughị-efu?), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ((3 ≥ 4) & (3 ≤ 5)), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (3 = 3), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (3 ≠ 3), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: 1 boolean, ahịrị-ọhụrụ.

Mmemme hichaa.

